# DSA Lab Tasks

## About

This repository contains my Data Structures and Algorithms (DSA) lab tasks completed during the semester at university.

## Repository Contents

All lab tasks are organized into separate ZIP files. Each ZIP file contains the corresponding lab work and completed tasks.

## Topics Covered

- Arrays
- Searching
- Sorting
- Pointers
- Dynamic Memory Allocation
- Linked Lists
- Stacks

## Programming Language

- C++

## Purpose

The purpose of this repository is to practice and understand Data Structures and Algorithms through practical lab assignments.

